'''Wayland''' is a [[Humans|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found at the crafting station near the [[Singing Crystal Mines]] in [[Snowhill]]. He sells exclusively [[Blacksmith]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Bending Blacksmith Apron]]
*[[Bending Blacksmith Goggles]]
*[[Bending Blacksmith Gloves]]
*[[Bending Blacksmith Boots]]
*[[Bending Blacksmith Shirt]]
*[[Blacksmith's Flair Shard of Tempering]]
*[[Blacksmith's Power Shard of Timing III]]
*[[Blacksmith's Necklace of Timing III]]
*[[Blacksmith's Forgeblower of Timing III]]

==Trivia==
*Wayland was introduced in-game on August 6, 2013.
